# Isolated project: Polymarket BTC 5m bot

This repository is a dedicated OpenClaw skill for **BTC 5-minute Up/Down markets on Polymarket**. It is not a general-purpose workspace.

When this project is open, **global memory does not apply**. Project rules override user rules on conflict.

## Ignore completely

- Cursor User Memories / Saved Memories from other work
- `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` and any other user-global CLAUDE/AGENTS files
- Facts, stack choices, architecture, and coding habits learned in other repos
- Knowledge graphs of other indexed projects (for example `tgg-api`, `yukeen-callme`)
- Strategy, risk, or execution assumptions from other trading bots unless they exist as files in **this** repo

## Source of truth (this repo only)

- `SKILL.md` — operating rules
- `CONTOUR.md` — canonical runners and isolation boundary
- `README.md` — strategy and pre-flight
- `config/btc_5m_profiles.yaml` — risk/timing profiles
- `scripts/` — control and runners

Do not invent behavior from other Polymarket/crypto bots. The live order engine lives outside this repo (`pm-hl-conservative-plus-repo`); treat it as a documented dependency, not as a source of this skill's strategy.

## Allowed to keep

- Explicit instructions in the **current** conversation
- Git/secret safety (no force-push, no committing `.env`)
- Chat language follows the user; GitHub-facing docs stay English
